.TH AVR\-SBOM\-LIST 1 "" "avr 0.4.1" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-sbom-list \- List the repository's recorded SBOMs, newest first.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr sbom list
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the repository's recorded SBOMs, newest first.
.PP
Counts shown as "?" were not recorded by the SBOM's schema version.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr sbom list --repo acme/api
    avr sbom list --repo acme/api --json commit_sha,copyleft_count
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    artifacts, branch, commit_sha, copyleft_count, generated_at,
    is_release, recorded_at, schema_version, total_dependencies,
    unresolved
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Repository (org/repo or rep-xxx). Auto-detected from git remote if omitted.
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-L\fR, \fB\-\-limit\fR \fIINTEGER RANGE\fR
Max SBOMs to return. (default: 50)
.TP
\fB\-\-cursor\fR \fITEXT\fR
Opaque cursor from a previous response's next_cursor.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-sbom (1),
.BR avr-sbom-download (1),
.BR avr-sbom-generate (1),
.BR avr-sbom-view (1)
